---
layout: layouts/guest.njk
permalink: /
pageTitle: "Seascape Vacations | Bradenton & Sarasota Vacation Rentals Near Anna Maria Island"
pageDescription: "Five private-pool vacation homes in Bradenton and Sarasota. Compare homes, plan with your group, and book direct with Seascape Vacations."
---
{% set oasis = properties | propertyBySlug("the-oasis") %}
<div class="g-home g-wrap">
  <section class="g-home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-heading">
    <div class="g-home-copy"><p class="g-label">Private-pool homes · Bradenton & Sarasota</p><h1 id="home-heading">Room for your<br><em>favorite people.</em></h1><p class="g-lede">A pool all to yourselves. Space to settle in. Five Gulf Coast homes, with a local team to help you choose.</p><a class="g-inline-link" href="/properties/" data-trip-link>Meet all five homes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <figure class="g-home-photo"><a href="{{ oasis.pageUrl }}" data-trip-link><img data-property-photo="the-oasis" src="{{ oasis.photography.photos[0].src }}" srcset="{{ oasis.photography.photos[0].src | replace('.webp', '-800.webp') }} 800w, {{ oasis.photography.photos[0].src }} 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 50vw, calc(100vw - 40px)" width="1400" height="933" alt="The Oasis pool and backyard at dusk" fetchpriority="high"></a><figcaption><strong>The Oasis, Bradenton</strong><a href="{{ oasis.pageUrl }}" data-trip-link>Evenings in your own backyard <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></figcaption></figure>
  </section>
  <section class="g-home-trip" aria-labelledby="home-trip-heading"><div><p class="g-label">A good place to start</p><h2 id="home-trip-heading">Who's coming along?</h2></div>{% set tripFormId = 'home-trip' %}{% include "partials/guest-trip-form.njk" %}</section>
  <section class="g-section" aria-labelledby="home-collection-heading"><div class="g-section-heading"><div><p class="g-label">Small collection. Different personalities.</p><h2 id="home-collection-heading">The house is part<br>of the vacation.</h2></div><p>Waterfront mornings, a backyard made for groups, or days around Sarasota. Start with what you want to do together.</p></div>
    <div class="g-featured-homes">{% for home in properties %}{% if home.slug in ['dockside-dreams','sarasota-luxe','bradenton-pool-home'] %}<article><a href="{{ home.pageUrl }}" data-trip-link><img data-property-photo="{{ home.slug }}" src="{{ home.photography.photos[0].src }}" srcset="{{ home.photography.photos[0].src | replace('.webp', '-800.webp') }} 800w, {{ home.photography.photos[0].src }} 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 30vw, calc(100vw - 40px)" alt="{{ home.name }}" width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy"><p class="g-label">{{ home.city }} · Up to {{ home.guests }} guests</p><h3>{{ home.name }}</h3></a><p>{{ home.guestFacts.tagline }}</p><a class="g-inline-link" href="{{ home.pageUrl }}" data-trip-link>Explore this home <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
    <div class="g-collection-end"><p>Also in the collection: <a href="/properties/the-oasis/" data-trip-link>The Oasis</a> and <a href="/properties/river-house/" data-trip-link>River House</a>.</p><a class="g-button btn-brand" href="/properties/" data-trip-link>Compare all five homes</a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="g-organizer g-section" aria-labelledby="organizer-heading"><div><p class="g-label">For the person planning it all</p><h2 id="organizer-heading">Less back-and-forth.<br>More “this is the one.”</h2><p>Choose a few homes, compare the rooms and details, then send one link to your group. Your dates and guest count stay with you as you explore.</p><a class="g-button btn-brand" href="/properties/" data-trip-link>Build your shortlist</a></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with your people</h3><p>Group size comes first. Then narrow by location or a private dock.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Check the details that matter</h3><p>Who sleeps where. Whether the dog can come. Steps, parking and pool heat.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Share a choice, then check dates</h3><p>Compare up to three homes. See the current availability and complete total on the booking page.</p></div></li></ol></section>
  <section class="g-local g-section" aria-labelledby="local-heading"><div><p class="g-label">The coast, with a local connection</p><h2 id="local-heading">A little help<br>goes a long way.</h2><p>Seascape is owner-operated. Before you book, ask us about the details that could make or break your stay. We know these five homes. <a href="/about-us/">Meet your hosts</a>.</p><a class="g-inline-link" href="tel:9417048545">Call (941) 704-8545 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="g-guide-list"><a href="/guides/bradenton-vs-sarasota/">Bradenton or Sarasota? <span>Compare the two areas →</span></a><a href="/guides/anna-maria-island-area-guide/">Beach days on Anna Maria Island <span>Plan from a mainland home →</span></a><a href="/guides/anna-maria-island-vs-siesta-key/">Anna Maria Island or Siesta Key? <span>Choose your beach day →</span></a><a class="g-inline-link" href="/guides/">Explore all local guides →</a></div></section>
  <section class="g-return g-section"><p class="g-label">Been here before?</p><h2>Your next stay can start with the home you already know.</h2><p>Find it in our five-home collection, choose your dates, and book direct. Have a question from your last visit? Our local team can help.</p><a class="g-inline-link" href="/properties/" data-trip-link>Find your home again <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
</div>

